## Goal
Show how the six samples of this RNA-seq project relate to one another in gene-expression space, using a principal component analysis of the gene counts, with samples coloured by `condition` (treated vs untreated), so that overall structure — separation by condition, outlying samples — can be judged by eye.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

| Artifact type | Resolved from | Path |
